[{:db/id 17592186096745 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-df6c8a6d-153a-5484-848d-1043ee95c582"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-df6c8a6d-153a-5484-848d-1043ee95c582" :question/id #uuid "df6c8a6d-153a-5484-848d-1043ee95c582" :question/math-academy-id "q-74621" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4x-11y+5z=-1 \\\\ x-3y+2z=1 \\\\ -3x+9y-6z=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -11 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 9 & -6 & -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}4 & -11 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 9 & -6 & -3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & ↔{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -11 & 5 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 9 & -6 & -3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-4){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ -3 & 9 & -6 & -3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the row echelon form above, we have only two pivots (in the $1$st and $2$nd columns). To transform the matrix to reduced row echelon form, we need to create zeros above the pivots only. This gives,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+3{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -7 & -14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a4a2cf38-1593-52f1-9b63-551383c8a50f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a4a2cf38-1593-52f1-9b63-551383c8a50f" :answer-field/id #uuid "a4a2cf38-1593-52f1-9b63-551383c8a50f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8076b85b-1614-5135-bb4c-2ab5d41377da" :answer-field/choices ["answer-8076b85b-1614-5135-bb4c-2ab5d41377da" "answer-d64479b7-f216-5594-be33-53f9d09c2c72" "answer-f1ebe9c7-57ca-5f13-b184-b18fa5a512d5" "answer-0ee5bd89-c4e9-5aea-ba6a-3f045af5c0e6" "answer-75130a5b-9607-5217-b80c-6757c94daf70"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8076b85b-1614-5135-bb4c-2ab5d41377da" :answer/id #uuid "8076b85b-1614-5135-bb4c-2ab5d41377da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -7 & -14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d64479b7-f216-5594-be33-53f9d09c2c72" :answer/id #uuid "d64479b7-f216-5594-be33-53f9d09c2c72" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -7 & -14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f1ebe9c7-57ca-5f13-b184-b18fa5a512d5" :answer/id #uuid "f1ebe9c7-57ca-5f13-b184-b18fa5a512d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & -14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0ee5bd89-c4e9-5aea-ba6a-3f045af5c0e6" :answer/id #uuid "0ee5bd89-c4e9-5aea-ba6a-3f045af5c0e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 11 & -14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-75130a5b-9607-5217-b80c-6757c94daf70" :answer/id #uuid "75130a5b-9607-5217-b80c-6757c94daf70" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 11 & -14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186096746 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-86e15f08-648b-5bcc-988f-7551732eb466"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-86e15f08-648b-5bcc-988f-7551732eb466" :question/id #uuid "86e15f08-648b-5bcc-988f-7551732eb466" :question/math-academy-id "q-131649" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-2x+2y-4z=4 \\\\ -x+y-2z=2 \\\\ x-y+2z=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & -4 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & -4 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & ↔{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -4 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -4 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-y+2z=-2 \\\\ 0x+0y+0z=0 \\\\ 0x+0y+0z=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince any numbers $x,y,z$ form a solution of the final two equations, we can remove these equations from the system. \n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x$, and we have two free variables, $y,$ and $z.$ That means we need to find $x$ in terms of $y$ and $z.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=y-2z-2 \\\\ y=y \\\\ z=z,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ and $z$ (the free variables) are arbitrary numbers.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}y-2z-2 \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8d6b9331-1da4-5d89-9d4a-e8d26ffe05e0"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8d6b9331-1da4-5d89-9d4a-e8d26ffe05e0" :answer-field/id #uuid "8d6b9331-1da4-5d89-9d4a-e8d26ffe05e0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-45df3fe7-8c4e-5624-afa2-3e1ab32743c2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-41cef48b-98a3-54bd-b406-d5e167d64ae9" "answer-0a7564c8-04d6-57a1-9a06-28d7b8421a35" "answer-d82b73e6-0a25-5302-99e8-b157a818667e" "answer-45df3fe7-8c4e-5624-afa2-3e1ab32743c2" "answer-3c1f7437-d98a-5bd7-97a0-2e5ff4f2f649"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-41cef48b-98a3-54bd-b406-d5e167d64ae9" :answer/id #uuid "41cef48b-98a3-54bd-b406-d5e167d64ae9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2-y+2z \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0a7564c8-04d6-57a1-9a06-28d7b8421a35" :answer/id #uuid "0a7564c8-04d6-57a1-9a06-28d7b8421a35" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}y+2z+2 \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d82b73e6-0a25-5302-99e8-b157a818667e" :answer/id #uuid "d82b73e6-0a25-5302-99e8-b157a818667e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}y-2z-1 \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-45df3fe7-8c4e-5624-afa2-3e1ab32743c2" :answer/id #uuid "45df3fe7-8c4e-5624-afa2-3e1ab32743c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}y-2z-2 \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3c1f7437-d98a-5bd7-97a0-2e5ff4f2f649" :answer/id #uuid "3c1f7437-d98a-5bd7-97a0-2e5ff4f2f649" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "No solution" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-fda0e0b8-3081-5e52-8593-c6700e3052bb" :activity/id #uuid "fda0e0b8-3081-5e52-8593-c6700e3052bb" :activity/title "Reduced Row Echelon Form" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186048742 :activity/course 17592186046659 :activity/steps ["step-1f437206-fa08-5382-b319-4b882827b9a2" "step-6e7d6a76-cc67-5b59-8e1b-d53698eacff0" "step-06ed1b32-abf8-5d02-b409-e83aa1a9bf69" "step-6862e7b5-f79b-5b64-a612-6d85862752ef" "step-9f34ebb7-b2e8-595a-840d-d43ea1cd168d"] :activity/first-step "step-1f437206-fa08-5382-b319-4b882827b9a2" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-1f437206-fa08-5382-b319-4b882827b9a2" :step/id #uuid "1f437206-fa08-5382-b319-4b882827b9a2" :step/content 17592186097174 :step/next "step-6e7d6a76-cc67-5b59-8e1b-d53698eacff0" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-6e7d6a76-cc67-5b59-8e1b-d53698eacff0" :step/id #uuid "6e7d6a76-cc67-5b59-8e1b-d53698eacff0" :step/content 17592186342242 :step/next "step-06ed1b32-abf8-5d02-b409-e83aa1a9bf69" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-06ed1b32-abf8-5d02-b409-e83aa1a9bf69" :step/id #uuid "06ed1b32-abf8-5d02-b409-e83aa1a9bf69" :step/content "question-df6c8a6d-153a-5484-848d-1043ee95c582" :step/next "step-6862e7b5-f79b-5b64-a612-6d85862752ef" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-6862e7b5-f79b-5b64-a612-6d85862752ef" :step/id #uuid "6862e7b5-f79b-5b64-a612-6d85862752ef" :step/content 17592186266102 :step/next "step-9f34ebb7-b2e8-595a-840d-d43ea1cd168d" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-9f34ebb7-b2e8-595a-840d-d43ea1cd168d" :step/id #uuid "9f34ebb7-b2e8-595a-840d-d43ea1cd168d" :step/content "question-86e15f08-648b-5bcc-988f-7551732eb466" :db/ensure [:step/validate]}]
